# Pricing Card

A visually appealing pricing card component to display product plans, features, and pricing details.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add "https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/pricing-card .json"
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add "https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/pricing-card .json"
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add "https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/pricing-card .json"
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { PricingCard } from '@/registry/pricing-card'

const features = ['Unlimited access', 'Priority support', 'Free updates']
const cons = ['Custom domain']
</script>

<template>
  <PricingCard 
    plan-name="Pro Plan" 
    :price="29.99" 
    coin="$" 
    :pros="features" 
    :cons="cons" 
    :is-most-popular="true" 
  />
</template>
```

