### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `planName` | `string` | `undefined` | The name of the pricing plan. |
| `price` | `number` | `undefined` | The price amount. |
| `coin` | `string` | `'$'` | Currency symbol (`$`, `€`, `£`, `¥`). |
| `pros` | `string[]` | `Default items` | List of features included in the plan. |
| `cons` | `string[]` | `Default items` | List of features NOT included in the plan. |
| `isMostPopular` | `boolean` | `false` | Highlights the card as the recommended option. |
| `paymentMethod` | `string` | `'month'` | Billing cycle text (e.g., `'month'`, `'year'`). |

### Slots

| Slot | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `default` | Custom content area for the features list. |
